00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:30.950
if I do good behavior.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.444
And that's how I think
about my businesses.

00:00:33.444 --> 00:00:34.770
- Yeah.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.183
- [Gary] You got your perspective.

