- Couple things, one, you know,
one of the great advantages

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:56.160
of my life is that I was born
in the former Soviet Union

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:00.040
and so, and then my first business,

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.470
which was a family business,
which obviously means

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:06.500
I love it so much like a child
was in the wine business.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.210
So, the amount of time I
spent in France and Italy,

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:12.930
Spain, so as an American
and I think, you know,

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.910
obviously, I moved to
the US when I was three

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:19.180
and for like any place, there's things

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:20.630
