00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.610
And so, that's amazing.

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:51.203
Leads me to my answer.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.860
Sweden, which, this is probably my seventh

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:55.740
or eighth trip here,

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.550
'cause I've done a lot of speaking here

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.963
