00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:12.910
I think the maturity of Europe as a whole

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.330
and then specifically in the Nordics

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.690
and then specifically to Sweden,

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.200
my number one thing that
interests me about Sweden is

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.790
I kind of think it's, I guess
I almost think sometimes

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.010
that I'm looking at the
place that my grandchildren

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:27.770
